    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like Raptor, but its Sweden. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flight Weapon</i> is an alt-history arcade air combat game where you pilot retro jet fighters through a Cold War gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the USSR, resist the USA, and take back Sweden \u2013 one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweden is the last neutral zone \u2013 caught between Soviet-controlled Europe and opportunistic US forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a surprise invasion, you join a squadron of restored analog fighters \u2013 Fafners and Skrakens \u2013 to strike back in a 10-mission campaign inspired by 90s DOS classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its offline-first design, FM-synth soundtrack and zero microtransactions, <strong>Flight Weapon</strong>\u00a0brings back the punch of pixel-era air combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818780/extras/38a93d6c7a2500f5608a2e4cf7bf0a3d.avif?t=1755082877\" width=616 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2708\ufe0f Fast-paced 2D arcade air combat  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Story-driven campaign with SNES-style cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f Fly iconic Swedish jets inspired by real life counterparts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Original soundtrack composed on a 1983 Yamaha DX7  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc Retro graphics inspired by early Windows &amp; MS-DOS titles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0c 100% offline \u2013 no accounts, launchers or subscriptions  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like Raptor, but its Sweden. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flight Weapon</i> is an alt-history arcade air combat game where you pilot retro jet fighters through a Cold War gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the USSR, resist the USA, and take back Sweden \u2013 one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweden is the last neutral zone \u2013 caught between Soviet-controlled Europe and opportunistic US forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a surprise invasion, you join a squadron of restored analog fighters \u2013 Fafners and Skrakens \u2013 to strike back in a 10-mission campaign inspired by 90s DOS classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its offline-first design, FM-synth soundtrack and zero microtransactions, <strong>Flight Weapon</strong>\u00a0brings back the punch of pixel-era air combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818780/extras/38a93d6c7a2500f5608a2e4cf7bf0a3d.avif?t=1755082877\" width=616 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2708\ufe0f Fast-paced 2D arcade air combat  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Story-driven campaign with SNES-style cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f Fly iconic Swedish jets inspired by real life counterparts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Original soundtrack composed on a 1983 Yamaha DX7  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc Retro graphics inspired by early Windows &amp; MS-DOS titles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0c 100% offline \u2013 no accounts, launchers or subscriptions  </p>",
